    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="achievements-and-impact">
      <h2 id="achievements-and-impact">Achievements and impact</h2>
      <p>Turning commitment into action.</p>
      <p>Since 2022, the AIWG has contributed to advancing accessibility and inclusion through practical initiatives, educational research, awareness activities and collaborative partnerships.</p>
      <h3>Education</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Established a shared definition and position on accessibility within the School of Informatics.</li>
        <li>Introduced microphone-use reminder posters to promote accessible teaching and meeting practices.</li>
        <li>Secured PTAS funding for interdisciplinary research into embedding accessibility across higher education.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Awareness</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Organised accessibility awareness activities, invited talks and academic presentations.</li>
        <li>Connected academic, industry and lived-experience perspectives to promote understanding of accessibility barriers.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Innovation</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Established the Skyscanner Accessibility and Inclusion Award in 2024 to recognise outstanding student innovation.</li>
        <li>Promoted accessibility-focused undergraduate and postgraduate research.</li>
        <li>Developed AccessAIthon as a flagship initiative connecting accessibility, artificial intelligence and student innovation.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Collaboration</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Established collaborations across Schools and professional services within the University.</li>
        <li>Developed relationships with industry partners and accessibility professionals.</li>
        <li>Promoted interdisciplinary research and knowledge exchange.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Looking ahead</h3>
      <p>We aim to expand accessibility education, awareness activities, research and collaborative opportunities while continuing to develop practical resources and evaluate the impact of our initiatives.</p>
      <p>Explore <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'our-work/'}>Our Work</a> to discover more about our activities and flagship initiatives.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Site>
